{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b297c0a9cea93ef8a51b61167b54d527bf1c2e2581939cf84eafbded463880",
      "text": "在电视节目中宣传歌曲的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d77cb024404855ab57a502795bfe75aaa0fcc4f39ffacc45b60c01f9c39cc0f3",
      "text": "早上好。\n是的，今天是要录制电视节目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a9ea8a843dd4206350b19e2022fe2c7f9e9bf1180fed0cf48e59a931101705",
      "text": "（终于打完一圈招呼了。……咦？\n和锐心先生在说话的那个人难道是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10071a4059d335ed67f78e81982e265f95c9e0dbe45d31a5a3c4196eaa06a97d",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n为了有朝一日能与您合作，我会继续精进的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a5f529cd3e8709426c0145a2d3099b034205010cf542fd92083675f2daa4505",
      "text": "那个，锐心先生。刚才和您说话的那位，\n难道是那位著名的演员……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb0b18dad98a880bac68e22493c9efdd546fb2b7a6ef7958e4c0ed53c137425",
      "text": "是的。他是我父母的朋友，\n我也见过他几次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c96e9fc742c74160ed56b367f579b4f664c1dd8300aa9f9133363f2ae086a233",
      "text": "我告诉他等下要进行录制，\n他说“很期待正式播出”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a241d0d8f90fed45686f0e9e5ca6b83f633d95146e56682c7262c645ffda4a0",
      "text": "竟然能得到那位著名演员的期待……！\n锐心先生，我们要加油了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341441bc63e03a82a1e3911c4e10da84926e736cd85722d227a2c2b77625ffe4",
      "text": "不用你说，我也只会\n去达成你所期望的成果而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41572d15a5783f102ca7fd73389adcfb2cbc654aa4805ed398e16a4e47bcea19",
      "text": "这是和秀以及百百人多次商讨后，\n发挥出我们当前最佳水平的一首歌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_03:1_5_049_03:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b88b8dc816fb6a1472cbee4eeeffc9233b201e4ade32598e30a37c84d964e04c",
      "text": "录制时的幕后故事吗。\n让我想想，最初拿到歌词的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
